That's the one we want.
就是我们要的那一个。

1232
00:46:37.820 --> 00:46:40.340
And so then they were like, pull it together.
然后他们就说，稳住情绪。

1233
00:46:40.740 --> 00:46:41.680
And do it again.
再来一次。

1234
00:46:41.840 --> 00:46:42.380
Do it again.
再来一次。

1235
00:46:42.500 --> 00:46:42.720
Okay.
好的。

1236
00:46:42.820 --> 00:46:43.780
I have a question for you.
我有个问题想问你。

1237
00:46:43.900 --> 00:46:46.160
When he says, shut up, I know exactly what to do.
当他说“闭嘴，我知道该怎么做”时。

1238
00:46:46.280 --> 00:46:47.240
