00:47:07.360 --> 00:47:07.580
up.
闭嘴。

1249
00:47:07.720 --> 00:47:14.840
I also love when Rain, how Rain responds to me saying like, she's a little like tightly
我也很喜欢雷恩，雷恩回应我说“她有点神经质”时的样子。

1250
00:47:14.840 --> 00:47:15.200
wound.
紧绷。

1251
00:47:15.480 --> 00:47:15.540
Oh gosh.
天哪。

1252
00:47:15.540 --> 00:47:16.800
And he's like, yeah.
然后他说，没错。

1253
00:47:16.800 --> 00:47:19.220
He like chose to be like turned on by it.
他好像选择对此感到兴奋。

1254
00:47:19.300 --> 00:47:20.040
It's so gross.
太恶心了。

1255
00:47:20.220 --> 00:47:20.760
Kind of creepy.
有点毛骨悚然。

1256
00:47:21.040 --> 00:47:25.680
Did you notice how many times we were in scenes in the break room in the kitchen?
你注意到我们在休息室和厨房的场景有多少次了吗？

1257
00:47:26.200 --> 00:47:28.520
