他说，我不行。

1280
00:48:19.080 --> 00:48:20.200
I have plans with friends.
我和朋友有约。

1281
00:48:20.680 --> 00:48:21.520
And I can't.
我没法去。

1282
00:48:21.620 --> 00:48:22.320
It's so cringy.
太尴尬了。

1283
00:48:22.320 --> 00:48:24.780
And she's like, oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, no, it's not a problem.
然后她说，噢，是啊，是啊，是啊，没问题。

1284
00:48:25.040 --> 00:48:25.420
Not a problem.
